  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "孙悟空在风雪中遭遇一个他从未见过的对手，感到自己的每一举动都在对方预料之中。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 2
          },
          "anchor": "孙悟空发现自己遇上了从未见过的对手"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "孙悟空觉得自己像在同一个幻影作战：每次认为要击中对手时，对手都奇迹般地避开。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 4
          },
          "anchor": "孙悟空觉得自己在同一个幻影作战"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "孙悟空一瞬之间变幻几十个位置、攻出上百招，但每次金箍棒击下都只击中空气。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 5
          },
          "anchor": "每次金箍棒击下，却又只击中了空气"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "孙悟空的金箍棒与对手的棒相撞，他感觉自己像用力击在钢铁上，金箍棒嗡鸣，震荡从手心直传到心脏。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 14
          },
          "anchor": "震荡从手心直传到心脏"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "孙悟空想到：对手与他一样同时向四面八方攻击，因此同样无法击中目标；他每次能击中对手时也是对手能击中自己之时，所以双棒相击、力量互消。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 11
          },
          "anchor": "他每次可以击中对手时，也是对手可以击中自己之时"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "孙悟空疑惑自己究竟在和什么作战，并判断这样下去战斗也许永远分不出胜负。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 19
          },
          "anchor": "战斗也许是永不能分出胜负的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "观音（据孙悟空回忆）曾说：「你杀了他，紧箍咒自然就解除了」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0019/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0019"
      },
      "revealed_at": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000038.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000038",
          "chapter_order": 38,
          "locator": {
            "para": 20
          },
          "anchor": "你杀了他，紧箍咒自然就解除了"
        }
